    "summary": "Man&#039;s cotton tunic, made of narrow strips of cloth, dyed dark brown and machine-stitched together. The tunic is straight, with wide short sleeves, side vents, rounded neck and slit opening at front. Hem of tunic has raw edge with tassels at intervals. Tunic decorated on front and back with narrow strips of metal in figurative designs. Front of tunic has square pocket on left; back has openwork net of twisted and dyed cotton thread, secured by metal strips to form lozenges attached at the midpoint.",
